Summarise a nextest JUnit report for the GitHub job page

Usage: cargo xtask test-summary <LABEL> <JUNIT>

Arguments:
  <LABEL>
          The label for the summary

  <JUNIT>
          The JUnit report

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
